+     *
+     * Caller computes eligibleVoters off-chain (CLI loops over creatorHatIds
+     * + counts wearers via Hats.balanceOf). On-chain we trust the caller's
+     * lower-bound: an UNDER-count makes early-close MORE achievable (smaller
+     * threshold) which is acceptable per RISK 1 in DESIGN.md. An OVER-count
+     * makes early-close HARDER, which is also acceptable (timer fallback).
+     *
+     * Per the design's open question Q1: caller-passed (option a) chosen
+     * over contract-computed (option b — Hats balanceOf loop is gas-expensive
